Subject: The server is back

who knows that while cpan chokes your server causing
the OS itself to kill the process every time cpanm
would have your back and just... get the stuff done.

it even got me to notice that i didn't have -lz (zlib)
installed!  and all i had to do was apt-get install zlib1g-dev.
it's pretty nice, and my deployment script is passing too.

index page has been updated as well, just fyi. :)
